      "explanation": "<p>Metamers are compounds which have different alkyl groups\npresent along both side of polyvalent functional group.</p>\n<p>No polyvalent functional group in option (a).</p>\n<p>The two functional groups are different in option (b).</p>\n<p>Alcohol is not a polyvalent functional group.</p>\n<p>Alkyl groups are different along both sides of polyvalent\nfunctional group.</p>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l09uwjfd/efe56874-6a5a-4ba1-8d43-247dc0d33bc0/86939490-9a51-11ec-b1c5-39b9b722e9af/file-1l09uwjfe.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l09uwjfd/efe56874-6a5a-4ba1-8d43-247dc0d33bc0/86939490-9a51-11ec-b1c5-39b9b722e9af/file-1l09uwjfe.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2021 (Online) 20th July Evening Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 190 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l09uwjfd/efe56874-6a5a-4ba1-8d43-247dc0d33bc0/86939490-9a51-11ec-b1c5-39b9b722e9af/file-1l09uwjfe.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l09uwjfd/efe56874-6a5a-4ba1-8d43-247dc0d33bc0/86939490-9a51-11ec-b1c5-39b9b722e9af/file-1l09uwjfe.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l09uwjfd/efe56874-6a5a-4ba1-8d43-247dc0d33bc0/86939490-9a51-11ec-b1c5-39b9b722e9af/file-1l09uwjfe.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l09uwjfd/efe56874-6a5a-4ba1-8d43-247dc0d33bc0/86939490-9a51-11ec-b1c5-39b9b722e9af/file-1l09uwjfe.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l09uwjfd/efe56874-6a5a-4ba1-8d43-247dc0d33bc0/86939490-9a51-11ec-b1c5-39b9b722e9af/file-1l09uwjfe.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l09uwjfd/efe56874-6a5a-4ba1-8d43-247dc0d33bc0/86939490-9a51-11ec-b1c5-39b9b722e9af/file-1l09uwjfe.png?format=